      "updated_at": "2022-03-10T12:27:54Z",
      "body": "I just deployed the latest version of the code to [dapp.tgrade.finance](https://dapp.tgrade.finance) in order to check the functionality of the cookie banner, the cookies button, and the correct storage of Google Analytics' cookies.\r\n\r\nI have tested that:\r\n- The cookie banner does not show on reload.\r\n- The cookie banner can be shown if the user clicks on the Cookies button.\r\n- The Google Analytics cookies get stored or deleted depending on the user accepting or rejecting, and this can be modified as many times as desired by using the Cookies button.",
